Click
=====

Click is derived from TILIK (an earlier intelligence-engine codebase; some
historical trees also used the Veyra name). The architecture — understand →
plan → execute → verify → reason → answer — the Hono/TypeScript backend, the
static web client, and the security/tooling layers were adapted from that
product and ported from an EVM chain to Solana.

The upstream tree did not ship a LICENSE file. Copying or redistributing this
source is not clearly permitted. Treat Click as proprietary / all rights
reserved until the rights holder publishes a grant.

This NOTICE file is the canonical place for that attribution. Product code,
tests, and operator docs use Click/Solana names only.
